My old tried-and-true when I haved decided to kill a
priest because I want to convert the altar.  I only do
it if I haven't found a non-shrine altar for a bunch of
other levels and I would rather have a co-aligned altar
for sacrafice and prayer than a cross-aligned priest
for donations.

Best is use another altar and don't kill the priest -
You never know when donating will be wanted and the
next guaranteed priest is in the VotD.

Second best is to have your pet do the killing - Your
diety won't get angry at you.

Third best is to actively decide to kill the priest
and do all of the prep work to make it as painless as
you can, but you will at least have to do some
sacraficing as such.

Dead last in the order of priorities is getting the
priest accidentally angry and kill him to solve the
problem.  Funny how this seems to be about tied with
not killing the priest at all for commoness.  Especially
common use a chaotic gets Stormbringer.

