Regular altar camping leads folks to believe that every
monster sacraficed will count towards your goal.  For
prayer timeout, it is true.  For getting artifact gifts
it doesn't even matter if you offer a newt corpse or a
dragon corpse once you're in good graces.

Not true to reverse an angry diety.  It takes "powerfull"
monsters where "powerfull" is pretty mean for lawfull and
neutral, extremely mean for chaotic.  It works well to
create monsters that leave corpses you can't pick up,
maneuver them onto the altar, kill and offer them there.
Giants, dragons, "q"s at least as big as wumpus's.

